# Approved roaming partners for the device's home SIM.
#
# Format:  MCC MNC  COUNTRY  OPERATOR  [PRIORITY]
#
# MCC/MNC are the visited network identifiers as reported by
# `qmicli --nas-get-serving-system` and `--nas-network-scan=lte`.
# COUNTRY is an ISO-3166-1 alpha-2 code, used only to group the
# list for humans; the script matches purely on MCC/MNC.
# PRIORITY (optional, lower = tried first) orders partners when
# multiple are visible on the same scan. Defaults to 100.
#
# When `cell-data wake` cannot attach in automatic mode within its
# budget, it does a `nas-network-scan=lte` and tries manual attach
# to each visible partner in priority order. Entries not in this
# file are never tried (prevents accidental roaming on networks
# without a billing agreement).
#
# Home SIM: Singtel SG (MCC=525 MNC=01) — Singtel ReadyRoam partner
# list, LTE-only. Source: https://www.singtel.com/ (verify before
# each trip — agreements change).

